sequenceDiagram
    actor Clerk as Celestial Clerk
    participant Court as Heavenly Court
    participant W as Sun Wukong
    participant E as Erlang Shen
    participant L as Laozi Vault

    Clerk->>Court: Incident Report #001 (Title dispute)
    Court->>W: Assign "Bimawen" post
    W-->>Court: Rejects symbolic downgrade
    W->>W: Self-declare "Great Sage Equal to Heaven"

    Court->>Clerk: Upgrade alert level to RED
    W->>Court: Unauthorized appearance at peach banquet
    W->>L: Consume elixirs from secure storage

    Court->>E: Dispatch for direct engagement
    E->>W: Duel with shape-shift counters
    alt Erlang gains tactical edge
        W->>W: Execute rapid transformation chain
        W-->>E: Escape with cloud somersault
    else Stalemate
        E-->>Court: Requires strategic containment support
    end

    Court->>Court: Approve external containment protocol
    Note over Court,W: Havoc phase ends, long-term fallout begins
